From 79f228c84fc11a3830fd6425409497f106bf4075 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thrivetoday <289389247+thrivetoday@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 11:30:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Button icons: the text's pad icons as the PS2's, a PS5's
 or an Xbox One's, or Auto by the controller last used

- Controller page row "Button icons" (Original / PS5 / Xbox One / Auto), saved as button_icons.
- crate::button_icons draws the PS5 (white outline symbols; L1 R1 L2 R2) and Xbox One (A B Y X in colour by position;
  LB RB LT RT) cells in code on the disc cells' footprints; hud_render::apply_button_icons rewrites the three fonts'
  cells 0x10..0x19 in the HUD atlas on a change and in every new atlas, so every prompt follows.
- Auto: PS5 for a Sony pad, Xbox One for any other, as gms::Gms::active. RC_DUMP_BUTTONS=<dir> dumps the cells.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
