From 425e9e86e5b9b0e185874883127f64a66915ea4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thrivetoday <289389247+thrivetoday@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:13:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] Sharp button icons: PS5 and Xbox icons drawn at the
 window's resolution

With the PS5 or Xbox One style, the pad icons in the HUD's and page menus'
text are drawn as UI images over the 512x416 layer instead of 24x16 cells,
fitted to the cells' footprints and dimmed by the fades drawn over them.

Art: "PS5 Button Icons and Controls" and "Xbox Series Button Icons and
Controls" by Zacksly, licensed under CC BY 3.0 - https://zacksly.itch.io
(renamed; scaled and tinted when drawn). See
crates/rc-engine/assets/button_icons/CREDITS.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
