+# Button icon credits
+
+The sharp PS5 and Xbox button icons (Port Options → Controller → Button icons) are by Zacksly:
+
+- **PS5 Button Icons and Controls** - Zacksly, licensed under CC BY 3.0 - https://zacksly.itch.io
+  (`ps5/`: from *Buttons Outline / White / 128w*)
+- **Xbox Series Button Icons and Controls** - Zacksly, licensed under CC BY 3.0 - https://zacksly.itch.io
+  (`xbox/`: from *Buttons Outline / White / 128w*; ReRAC shows them as its Xbox One icons)
+
+Licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/ (each pack's `LICENSE.txt` is in its folder).
+
+**Modified**: the files are renamed. The game scales them down to the text's size and tints them with the text's
+colour when it draws them.
